```console
$ scherzo-cloud run input-set delete --help
Logically delete a Run Input Set and schedule content cleanup

Usage: scherzo-cloud run input-set delete [OPTIONS] --yes <ORGANIZATION> <INPUT_SET>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <INPUT_SET>     Exact Run Input Set ID

Options:
      --yes                  Confirm logical deletion and scheduled content cleanup
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
      --json                 Write one JSON result to standard output
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
